{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271120","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1027112001:0":{"text":"다미안, 괜찮아?","source_cn":"达米安，你没事吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x331F2CC815F09D41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027112002:0":{"text":"나? 난 괜찮아요!","source_cn":"我？我好着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66051B81E83631CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027112003:0":{"text":"방금 리프를 해치려 하지 않았어요?","source_cn":"但是你们刚才，是不是想伤害一叶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD02AD8735DEEAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1027112003":{"text":"방금 리프를 해치려 하지 않았어요?","source_cn":"但是你们刚才，是不是想伤害一叶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD02AD8735DEEAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027112004:0":{"text":"방금 본 빛나는 꽃이요! 제 친구예요!","source_cn":"我的好朋友！刚刚那只荧荧花！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA0C04106E905CFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027112005:0":{"text":"뭐?! 저 녀석이 네가 만난다는 친구야?!","source_cn":"啊？！那家伙就是你要见的朋友？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A34B11E66EFB35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027112006:0":{"text":"이름까지 지어주다니... 반려동물이 따로 없네!","source_cn":"说是宠物还差不多……你甚至给它取名字了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x343D36F863AE0CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027112007:0":{"text":"미안해, 다미안. 네 친구가 아니라 열매를 뺏으러 온 야생 생물인줄 알았어...","source_cn":"对不起，达米安，我们不知道它是你的朋友，还以为它是想要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6FE00A478AF31E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027112008:0":{"text":"아, 반딧불이 열매요? 그건 원래 리프를 위해 준비한 거예요.","source_cn":"啊，你说那些萤瓤果吗，那些本来就是给一叶准备的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D0224ED52EE3E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1027112008":{"text":"아, 반딧불이 열매요? 그건 원래 리프를 위해 준비한 거예요.","source_cn":"啊，你说那些萤瓤果吗，那些本来就是给一叶准备的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D0224ED52EE3E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027112009:0":{"text":"네. 리프는 달콤한 과일과 샘물만 먹어요, 그 누구도 절대 해치지 않는다고요!","source_cn":"对呀，一叶只喜欢吃甜水果，喝泉水，不会伤害任何人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB2A3D0B947D031","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네. 리프는 달콤한 과일과 샘물만 먹어요, 그 누구도 절대 해치지 않는다고요!","female":"네. 리프는 달콤한 과일과 샘물만 먹어요, 그 누구도 절대 해치지 않는다고요!","variant_male_record_index":"109276","variant_female_record_index":"109277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027112012:0":{"text":"예전에 밖에 나왔다가 가시나무 근위대에게 쫓긴 적이 있는데, 리프가 절 숲 속으로 끌고 들어와서 오솔길로 도망칠 수 있었어요.","source_cn":"之前外出的时候，荆棘卫队追着我不放，是一叶把我拽进草丛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15FB9929807DF8E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027112013:0":{"text":"하지만 그때 너무 정신이 없어서 미궁에 들어선 후 헤어졌고, 다시 만났을 때 리프는 가시나무 근위대에게서 간신히 도망친 상태였죠...","source_cn":"可那时太混乱了，我们进入迷宫之后就走散了。再见面的时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACCA68C587CBC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027112014:0":{"text":"리프는 상처투성이에다 갈 곳도 없었어요. 그래서 상처를 치료해줄 안전한 곳을 찾아야 했죠. 다행히 지금은 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"她满身是伤，也没地方去，我只能找个安全的地方让她养伤，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012252A4FACD8FA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1027112015:0":{"text":"그런데... 이렇게 식성이 좋을 줄은 몰랐어요.","source_cn":"不过……我确实没想到她胃口这么好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6F8ABA2DD7FC80A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum